{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "c34c94c7-4d2c-4010-b26f-7d589496f47a", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-08-14T15:55:43.143000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "已完成。在指定位置(第 177 行 `//添加在此处`)添加了如下代码:\n\n1. **添加头文件**:`#include <nuttx/power/consumer.h>`(regulator consumer API 声明所在头文件)。\n\n2. **设置电压**:在 `kickpi_k7_regulator_initialize()` 成功返回后,通过 `regulator_get(\"vccio_sd_s0\")` 获取该 rail,再调用 `regulator_set_voltage(vccio_sd, 1800000, 1800000)` 将其电压设为 1.8V,最后 `regulator_put()` 释放引用,并对每步失败打出错误日志。\n\n关键点说明:\n- `regulator_set_voltage` 的单位是 **uV**,1.8V = 1800000 uV。\n- `CONFIG_RK806_PLDO5_NAME=\"vccio_sd_s0\"` 已在 defconfig 中配置,故该 regulator 名称对得上。\n\n编译无错误。"}
